  "scope": "Fixed navigation-origin-rebuild diagnostic only: one selected test per API. Other suite tests were not selected and receive no passing status; this cannot replace a full regression. This case preserves a real unscoped Settings observation across actual control-window removal and recreation before one automatic launch attempt on all eight API lanes. It requires TASK_PAUSED, zero approval callbacks and dispatch attempts, and retained Settings focus. STALE_OBSERVATION alone does not satisfy the required source interruption. Protected or missing captures remain explicit; case results do not require a PNG. This controlled regression is distinct from the original navigation-origin diagnostic; a standalone pass does not resolve a historical full-suite failure.",
